{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-tm-knot-pairs-table2-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:tm-knot-pairs-table2-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 2 from tm-knot-pairs","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tm-knot-pairs"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"tm-knot-pairs-table2-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:tm-knot-pairs-table2-data\"></a><p>Explicit entries of the neutron–neutron transfer matrix <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{nn}(q)</code> from Section 2b: the four matrix components, followed by its determinant <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\det = -1</code> (the product of its eigenvalues) and its trace <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{tr} = -(q - q^{-1})</code>, the negated Hecke amplitude <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q - q^{-1}</code>.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Entry</th>\n<th>Formula</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(1,1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(1,2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(2,1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(2,2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-(q - q^{-1})</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\det</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{tr}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-(q - q^{-1})</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-mass-binding-algorithms/tm-knot-pairs-table2-data.md","heading":"Table","page":"b/tbl-tm-knot-pairs-table2-data","qa":{"counts":{"pass":41,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":0}}}
